      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-03-14_WidnesExaminer_art0148" n="art0148">
        <p>New Warrington Curate. .At the Lent Ordination held by the Bishop of Is'lverPool the Rev. Thomas Phillips Owen, of t. David's College., Lampeter, was licensed curate to Holy Trinity, Warrington.</p>
        <p>,Pearson and Knowles' Dividend. Ihe directors of Messrs. Pearson and Knowles, t'td., have declared the usual half-year's divi- Fend at the rate of six per cent. per annum on hares. the preference and second preference Er also an interim dividend at the rate of ele% Per cent. per annum on the ordinary shares, all ta x.</p>
