        <p>After Influenza, ordered by the Doctor. Council School, Tremadoc, North \Vales. Dear Sirs,—Suffering from a bad attack of Influenza whict left me in a very weak condition, my doctor advised me to takt. Angie;,'s Emulsion to help my recovery. I quickly regained my customary condition, and ever since I keep a supply of your =- Emulsion in my house during the winter, My two little boy, take it as a very effective preventative against colds. I mr say it is most pleasing to the palate. (Sgd.) R. LLOYD JONES Md. Master' Free Sample Coupon.</p>
